Subject: [PATCH] RV V0: rv64 S-mode stub boots through OpenSBI

kernelrv target (clang --target=riscv64, ld.lld -m elf64lriscv);
boot.S hart lottery + .text.boot placement (OpenSBI jumps to the
payload base, not e_entry -- measured); SBI console with DBCN probe
and legacy fallback; DTB magic check; check_riscv_claims.py (8 claims,
selftest, in test-unit); rv_boot_smoke.sh (9 assertions incl. -smp 4).
